  data: {
    LLM: "As Alcalde, you have a 6-card hand. Use your first card of the trick to 'tease' and your second card to 'win' the point cards played by opponents.\n\nOpponents must coordinate their discards. If one opponent 'feeds' a point card to the trick, the other should play a trump if they suspect the Alcalde will scoop it.\n\nExchange management: If you have the 7 of trumps, wait until the Life card (e.g., an Ace) is about to be drawn or until you need it to win a critical 60-point trick.",
    Player: "As Alcalde, you have a 6-card hand. Use your first card of the trick to 'tease' and your second card to 'win' the point cards played by opponents.\n\nOpponents must coordinate their discards. If one opponent 'feeds' a point card to the trick, the other should play a trump if they suspect the Alcalde will scoop it.\n\nExchange management: If you have the 7 of trumps, wait until the Life card (e.g., an Ace) is about to be drawn or until you need it to win a critical 60-point trick.",
